{"overview":"Eiichirō Maruo (nicknamed \"Ei-chan\" for his grades being straight \"A\") is an honor student, bookworm, and is not interested in anything other than studying. In order to solve his problem of lacking physical strength, he enrolled a tennis school and soon found the fascinating side of tennis. Being a tennis newbie lacking physical strength, he supplement his shortcomings with his excellent observing and analyzing skills.","tagline":"","overview_en":"","tagline_en":"","runtime":25,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":25,"y":2014,"poster":"/fJQlz57BDTeBxMM0wmQMuqTijRg.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":25,"y":2015,"poster":"/rdrOAwwmc0P2NizWchE4ucJgptN.jpg"}],"episodes":50,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"村田太志","role":"Eiichiro Maruo (voice)","photo":"/eVs2Ow2CyiFfoN02EUNyhmSYALE.jpg","en":"Taishi Murata"},{"name":"寿美菜子","role":"Natsu Takasaki (voice)","photo":"/puocmMfvql6X1AvhFTolaV6Vh2r.jpg","en":"Minako Kotobuki"},{"name":"浪川大輔","role":"Takuma Egawa (voice)","photo":"/iw0X8oDutxaBAri3Ifga8nhdUJK.jpg","en":"Daisuke Namikawa"},{"name":"瀬戸麻沙美","role":"Himeko Sasami (voice)","photo":"/iKKCPgKrNd4pJ0iBOC1SBZy2Y4Y.jpg","en":"Asami Seto"},{"name":"下野紘","role":"Yukichi Fukasawa (voice)","photo":"/yrSDcgFefHtWkFmLnTrcw2t0MV.jpg","en":"Hiro Shimono"},{"name":"楠大典","role":"Coach Yusaku Miura (voice)","photo":"/jzruzwQOdyiJyOQ7Y6Q9Ds3xU2I.jpg","en":"Taiten Kusunoki"},{"name":"寺島拓篤","role":"Kojirou Kageyama (voice)","photo":"/n5uCihb318AzQCT9gieMlI2ueYL.jpg","en":"Takuma Terashima"},{"name":"柿原徹也","role":"Takuya Miyagawa (voice)","photo":"/80DeAD6DYh030wsyUygFqDpNkSj.jpg","en":"Tetsuya Kakihara"},{"name":"優希知冴","role":"Yuuki Tajima (voice)","photo":"/1EkJLh2R2tL2u1Y3dmVkefGEuu.jpg","en":"Chisa Yuuki"},{"name":"鳥海浩輔","role":"Coach Ryuuhei Aoi (voice)","photo":"/vlRQ77taCCKh7itCZn3IWJUiYQr.jpg","en":"Kohsuke Toriumi"},{"name":"KENN","role":"Yoshiaki Ide (voice)","photo":"/y7Gtn1PchXJ1MxmUxU9jtt138EO.jpg"},{"name":"細谷佳正","r